  title: THE CHARITY BAZAAR
  description: My Pontiff, the bazaar we sponsored in the Agora has opened its gates,
    and the crowds are already thick as locusts. Stalls bearing our sigil sell trinkets,
    sweetmeats and blessed oils. A cleric asks how the proceeds should be handled.
  premise: Sponsor a market stall run in the sect's name. Where the crowds go, the
    coin follows.
